        "orario": "15:20",
        "timestamp": 1780579250,
        "contenuto_esteso": "In Lebanon, Israeli targeted strikes carried out outside Hezbollah’s traditional areas are putting increasing strain on relations between the country’s different communities. In some neighborhoods, the presence of Hezbollah members or displaced people from the south is now sparking concern, mistrust, and at times even rejection. FRANCE 24’s team on the ground reports."
